  "fullDescription": "Flowers set Boho watercolor painting. Alphabet letters and numbers black, gold and linen for monogram, initials. Illustrations clipart hand drawn. PNG files.\n\nBright hand painted watercolor flowers, clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 193 items:\n– 30 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3000 px x 4000 px / 10 in x 13,3 in);\n– 16 bouquets and 3 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3500 px x 6000 px / 11,7 in x 20 in);\n– 1 repeating border in PNG files with transparent background (size 6000 px x 4000 px /20 in x 13,3 in);\n– 5 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 5 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white and colored background (different sizes 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in and 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 6 linen frames in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes 6000 px x 5000 px / 20 in x 16,7 in);\n7 backgrounds for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers black color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers gold color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 27 letters, 10 numbers linen color in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 3000 px / 10 in x 10 in);\n– 9 backgrounds, splashes, ets in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 4000 px / 10 in x 13,3 in and 2000 px x 3000 px / 6,7 in x 10).\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
